    (one per item in js/projects.js and js/posts.js). ADD A LINE HERE whenever you
    add a project or an article, and delete the line if you remove one.
  - Not listed on purpose: case-study.html and journal-post.html on their own
    (they show "not found"), and 404.html.
  - No <lastmod> dates: Google ignores them unless they are kept accurate.
-->

